        "version": "1.0.0.1",
        "description": "A custom Diverging Stacked Bar Chart visual for Power BI that displays data extending in opposite directions from a central baseline. Useful for visualizing survey results (like Likert scales), sentiment analysis, or comparing contrasting metrics across categories. Supports customizable bars, colors, tooltips, filters, slicers, and much more.",
